            "body": "> This also results in two progress reports\r\n\r\nNot ideal imo (but also not worth any \"hacks\"). Have been thinking about how to deal with that for [Guh](https://github.com/justinmk/guh.nvim), since there are often many async tasks happening.\r\n\r\nBut otherwise this PR has nice improvements.",
